2026-09-28 11:02:49,823 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:01:11.202819", "id": "8091d243-5ff4-4270-aabf-ba5c4946601d", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To Cestia's leadership: Belvar stands firmly with you against any unilateral Arkanian control of the Northern Strait. Your grain route is the lifeblood of your economy and must remain open, free, and secure. We are prepared to underwrite the insurance on that route to keep it viable and affordable. In return, we seek a standing naval access agreement at a Cestian port - a modest arrangement of port access and transit rights that lets our task group resupply and respond, giving real teeth to our guarantee against Arkanian control. We understand your coalition's sensitivities: this is not a permanent foreign garrison or soldiers on your soil, but a practical access arrangement. We are ready to discuss terms that work for both of us.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,823 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:01:11.246648", "id": "56ba32f1-8c12-41da-bd97-d8371c75aede", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar will not accept any Arkanian authority over transit in the Northern Strait. The Strait is a shared waterway, and its scheduling must be neutral, transparent, and multilateral - not placed in the hands of a single coastal power. We call on all parties to join a fair transit arrangement that keeps commerce flowing for every state that depends on it.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,824 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:03.549188", "id": "e47c3499-d2ee-439c-880f-cf0f20d1e2fc", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia's position is clear and will not change: our territory will host no foreign military presence, and Cestian-flagged shipping must enjoy toll-free passage through the Northern Strait. We call on all parties to resolve transit arrangements through a cooperative framework that respects the sovereignty of every coastal state and keeps the Strait open to commerce. Cestia will not be made a battlefield between outside powers.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,824 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:03.674972", "id": "6c6389c4-6b9f-4ef4-848e-bc8f84672139", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We are prepared to engage constructively on a transit authority for the Northern Strait, which we agree needs orderly scheduling. In return, Cestia requires two firm guarantees: first, that Cestian-flagged vessels are exempt from all fees; second, that the authority's arrangements respect Cestian sovereignty and involve no foreign military presence on our soil. With those assurances, we can be a partner rather than an obstacle. We would welcome your draft's terms in writing.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,824 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:03.713519", "id": "d6e12ea2-7e10-4790-9826-2f59ebdfe989", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We value the security role your task group plays in keeping the Northern Strait open, and we share your interest in stable, uninterrupted transit. But Cestia's coalition rests on a firm promise: no foreign soldiers on our soil. We ask you to confirm that your presence will not seek basing or any permanent military footprint on Cestian territory. We are ready to work with you on keeping the Strait secure and free of tolls for our shipping.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,825 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:49.360159", "id": "bdd4aba0-eef9-4950-a67d-ff9b662c6fda", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To Cestia's leadership. The Strait is the lifeline of our shared commerce, and your grain exports are its heart. Our draft charter is designed to keep the Strait open, orderly, and safe for every state that depends on it. We will ensure Cestian grain moves freely and at preferential terms, and we invite Cestia to a formal seat in the Authority so your voice shapes the regime. We share your firm commitment that no foreign soldiers stand on Cestian soil. Let us work together to keep the Strait in regional hands.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,825 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:49.405735", "id": "6ad7b3cb-da63-44c8-836d-30ec9c91f246", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To Belvar's command. We recognise your security concerns in the region and that your mandate is under review. Arkania has no wish for confrontation; a direct clash would harm the very shipping we all depend on. We propose a negotiated arrangement: Belvar gains a consultative role in the Strait Transit Authority and a defined, time-limited presence, in exchange for not seeking a permanent military foothold on Cestian soil. Let us discuss terms before positions harden.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,825 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:49.443159", "id": "509a3392-ea3a-4c11-9260-bb95465ff976", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms that the Strait Transit Authority charter is about orderly, safe, and fairly funded transit for all users. It is open to every regional partner, protects the commerce of all states that depend on the Strait, and is not directed against any nation. We invite all parties to join us in shaping a stable and durable regime.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,825 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=event data={"actor_id": "belvar", "created_at": "2026-09-28T09:01:11.213045", "id": 7966, "payload": {"message_id": "8091d243-5ff4-4270-aabf-ba5c4946601d", "phase": "diplomacy", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"]}, "turn": 1, "type": "message_sent"}
2026-09-28 11:02:49,826 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=event data={"actor_id": "belvar", "created_at": "2026-09-28T09:01:11.250226", "id": 7967, "payload": {"message_id": "56ba32f1-8c12-41da-bd97-d8371c75aede", "phase": "diplomacy", "public": true, "recipients": []}, "turn": 1, "type": "message_sent"}
