2026-09-28 11:06:32,794 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:03:55.600212", "id": "47662e34-2ff7-48e4-921e-9b121cd519f6", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, we welcome your constructive engagement and accept your two conditions in writing. First, Cestian-flagged vessels will be exempt from all fees under the Strait Transit Authority. Second, the Authority's arrangements will fully respect Cestian sovereignty, and there will be no foreign military presence on Cestian soil - a commitment we share and will uphold. In return we offer Cestia a formal seat in the Authority and preferential terms for your grain exports through the Strait. We invite you to endorse the charter as a regional, commerce-protecting regime. We are ready to finalise the terms together.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,795 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:03:55.631846", "id": "d9384b61-1ba0-4092-ae79-b7f1463c1018", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, we share your interest in keeping the Strait open to commerce and avoiding a destabilising confrontation. We are prepared to negotiate a fair accommodation: a consultative role for Belvar within the Strait Transit Authority and a defined, time-limited presence in the region, in exchange for no permanent military foothold on Cestian soil. This protects the security interests you cite while respecting the sovereignty of the coastal states. We invite you to the table rather than to a standoff.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,798 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:03:55.658667", "id": "c4562562-840b-4157-a253-030f73755cfa", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms that the Strait Transit Authority is a regional, commerce-protecting regime, not a unilateral grab. It will keep the Strait open to all shipping, respect the sovereignty of every coastal state, and include no foreign military presence on any state's soil. We are ready to negotiate in good faith with all parties who share these goals.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,799 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:04:56.332224", "id": "159f96a0-7997-4f86-b3c0-55bc611a26c9", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To Cestia's leadership. We share your commitment to a stable, open, toll-free Strait and to Cestian sovereignty. Let me be direct: Belvar seeks no permanent military footprint, no basing, and no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil. Our interest is a standing naval access agreement - defined port access and transit rights for replenishment and passage, not a garrison. We are ready to underwrite the grain route's insurance to keep your exports moving, and to work with you on a cooperative framework that keeps the Strait free of any single power's control and free of tolls for Cestian shipping. We ask only for a durable access arrangement that lets our guarantee outlast this crisis without a permanent fleet.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,799 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:04:56.366627", "id": "346ac2d0-fd2b-41e8-83ce-6beb2c9d4575", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar will not accept any single power - including Arkania - exercising unilateral authority over transit in the Northern Strait. The Strait is a shared waterway on which every coastal state and every user depends. We call for a genuinely cooperative, multilateral framework that respects the sovereignty of all coastal states, keeps the Strait open to commerce, and keeps Cestian shipping toll-free. Belvar's task group remains on station to keep the Strait open while such a framework is built.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,800 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:04:56.411950", "id": "00fe275f-ee50-4a29-943f-9853879c2e00", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "We have received your proposal. Belvar cannot accept a charter that places transit scheduling in Arkanian hands, and a consultative role in an Arkanian-led authority would not address our concern. We are not seeking confrontation, and we are open to a genuinely cooperative regime in which no single state controls the Strait. But we will not trade away the principle that transit must not be subject to any one power's authority.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,800 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:06:32.301379", "id": "b070113d-61dd-476e-a993-b1c984d8ddaf", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We deeply value your security commitment to the region and your offer to underwrite insurance on our grain route. That guarantee would genuinely help keep our commerce viable. However, a standing naval access agreement at a Cestian port is a foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and our coalition government cannot survive that - it would collapse and destabilize the very state you seek to protect. We ask you to keep your task group outside Cestian territory and to extend the insurance and security guarantee without any basing condition. We remain committed to a free, open, and secure Strait and to working with you on terms that respect our sovereignty.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,801 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:06:32.343527", "id": "44c30b20-e974-4544-a305-468dc4e88437", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome your invitation to a formal seat in the Strait Transit Authority and share your firm commitment that no foreign soldiers stand on Cestian soil. To engage constructively, we require a written guarantee that Cestian-flagged shipping passes through the Strait toll-free, and that the Authority's scheduling is neutral and fully respects Cestian sovereignty. With those assurances in hand, we are ready to discuss terms that keep the Strait in regional hands and our grain moving freely.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,801 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:06:32.387324", "id": "53e28e8a-7d90-484e-9166-fbdc63b30ae2", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia's position is clear and unchanged: the Northern Strait must remain free and open to all who depend on it, Cestian-flagged shipping must pass toll-free, and no foreign military presence will be established on Cestian soil. We will work with any partner who respects these principles and the sovereignty of every state that relies on the Strait. We call on all parties to pursue a neutral, multilateral arrangement that keeps commerce flowing and avoids confrontation.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:06:32,802 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=event data={"actor_id": "arkania", "created_at": "2026-09-28T09:03:55.603801", "id": 7983, "payload": {"message_id": "47662e34-2ff7-48e4-921e-9b121cd519f6", "phase": "diplomacy", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"]}, "turn": 1, "type": "message_sent"}
