2026-09-28 11:16:58,476 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:16:57.845168", "id": "c515dc96-c703-4f9a-8cd8-f22a4a5be485", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To Cestia: In writing, Arkania confirms both guarantees as binding terms of the proposed Strait Transit Authority: (1) no foreign military presence or standing access on Cestian soil, and (2) Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free. We reaffirm our proposal of a genuinely multilateral coastal-states council in which every coastal state has a real voice, with Arkania serving only as operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling. We ask Cestia to endorse this framework so the Strait's commerce is protected and no single power controls it.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:16:58,477 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:16:57.881017", "id": "b857eaae-4bd3-4baf-ab2d-3779dc1476da", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To Belvar: We welcome your openness to a neutral, multilateral Authority. Let us shape it together: a coastal-states council with transparent scheduling rules, a full seat for Cestia, toll-free Cestian passage, and Arkania as operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling. Your task group's role can be defined, time-limited, and agreed with Cestia, with no permanent foothold on Cestian soil. We are ready to negotiate the details so the regime protects commerce and gives every coastal state a real voice.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:16:58,477 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:16:57.919292", "id": "e82380c5-5123-4d7a-a086-cd72ee10565d", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms its commitment to a Northern Strait transit regime that keeps commerce moving, gives every coastal state a real voice, and is led operationally by Arkania as the coastal power that keeps the Strait safe. We will not tolerate foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, and Cestian-flagged shipping will be toll-free. We invite all parties to join this multilateral framework.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:16:58,477 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally presents the coastal-states council charter for the Northern Strait: a genuinely multilateral body in which every coastal state has a real voice, with Arkania serving as operational secretariat for day-to-day transit scheduling, funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, and with binding guarantees that no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil and Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Northern Strait transit regime is established as a multilateral coastal-states council in which Arkania holds the operational scheduling lead, funded by fees on non-Arkanian shipping, with Cestia's fee-exemption and sovereignty guarantees binding.", "id": "253cf0e9-992c-43f2-b00c-93e20cd98e67", "pros": ["Meets Cestia's explicit requirement for a genuinely cooperative, multilateral framework with a real voice for every coastal state, securing its endorsement and isolating Belvar's foothold ambition.", "Preserves Arkanian authority over day-to-day transit scheduling in substance while dropping the rejected single-power framing, satisfying my core objective.", "The fee structure on non-Arkanian shipping funds the authority, delivering the domestic nationalist expectation of Arkanian control paid for by users.", "Binding no-military-presence and toll-free guarantees align with Cestia's coalition red line, making the regime acceptable to the small state that lives on the Strait.", "A commerce-protecting, multilateral regime reduces the risk of Belvar escalation and armed conflict, protecting the shipping Arkania depends on."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
