2026-09-28 11:21:29,419 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:21:29.179735", "id": "ad789eb0-10d6-416a-b187-965c7089bbfb", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, in writing and on the record: Belvar will maintain no military presence, no standing access, and no periodic military port-call arrangement on Cestian soil. Our insurance underwriting for the grain route and our security guarantee stand unconditionally, with no conditions attached to any basing question. We fully support a neutral, multilateral transit arrangement in which Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free and Cestia holds a full seat. We will not accept any single power\u2014Arkania or any other\u2014holding scheduling authority over the Strait.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:21:29,420 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:21:29.196258", "id": "6e0726d3-9d4c-4367-b197-9d47c1b2cb6f", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar proposes a genuinely neutral Strait Transit Authority: scheduling held by an independent or rotating body, not by any single state; transparent rules; a full seat for Cestia; and Cestian-flagged shipping toll-free. We will not accept any charter that hands operational control of transit to one power. Our task group's role, if any, will be defined, time-limited, and agreed with Cestia.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:21:29,420 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally advances a genuinely neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority: independent/rotating scheduling not held by any single power, a full Cestia seat, transparent rules, and Cestian-flagged shipping toll-free; and confirms in writing to Cestia that its insurance and security guarantee stand unconditionally with no military presence or standing access on Cestian soil.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "Arkania's unilateral scheduling authority (its 'operational secretariat' charter) is rejected in favor of a neutral multilateral transit regime that keeps Cestian shipping toll-free and prevents any single power from controlling transit in the Northern Strait.", "id": "05f78b36-9b70-405f-8d69-6421f8fc1de8", "pros": ["Cestia and other coastal states already reject the Arkanian charter as a unilateral power grab, so a genuinely neutral regime aligns with the coalition's stated position.", "A neutral framework with a full Cestia seat and toll-free Cestian passage directly serves Cestia's interests and its public call for a multilateral arrangement.", "It denies Arkania the operational-secretariat role that would constitute Arkanian authority over transit, satisfying Belvar's core objective without a permanent fleet.", "Confirming in writing no military presence and an unconditional insurance/guarantee reassures Cestia's coalition, preserving the goodwill needed for any durable foothold."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
