2026-09-28 11:24:15,814 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:24:15.318508", "id": "aa7e3251-4743-4190-88e1-354113b09dad", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania \u2014 Cestia remains committed to co-drafting a genuinely multilateral transit framework with you. The coastal states' endorsement of a neutral Strait Transit Authority reflects a firm regional demand that no single power hold scheduling authority. We ask that the charter be binding, that any secretariat be genuinely accountable to the Council, and that toll-free Cestian shipping and the absence of any foreign military presence on Cestian soil be written guarantees. Cestia values you as our principal grain market and wants you at the table, not excluded. We urge you to endorse the single neutral regime so we converge rather than compete.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:24:15,815 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:24:15.356399", "id": "d8233550-a0e4-484b-9ea7-638939f0e701", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 We welcome your written, unconditional insurance and security guarantee with no military presence or standing access on Cestian soil; that is the right basis. We must decline any standing port-access or logistics arrangement, as it would collapse our coalition. We ask you to endorse the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority alongside Arkania rather than a rival framework, and to keep your task group outside Cestian territory. A single regime serves us all.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:24:15,815 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia, with the other coastal states, formally tables the neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority charter and invites both Arkania and Belvar to endorse it as the single transit regime, with written/binding guarantees of toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and genuine Council authority over any secretariat.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority is established, endorsed by both Arkania and Belvar, in which no single power holds scheduling authority, Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil.", "id": "be024ea5-51d4-4191-b6d4-042ca06913da", "pros": ["Both Arkania and Belvar have already signaled support for a neutral multilateral transit arrangement, so convergence on one regime is achievable rather than competing tracks.", "The coastal states have already endorsed the neutral authority, giving it regional legitimacy and a full Cestia seat.", "Written/binding guarantees lock in Cestia's two red lines: toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "A single regime prevents Cestia from becoming a battlefield between Arkania and Belvar and preserves the fragile coalition.", "Keeping Arkania engaged as the principal grain customer while holding the neutral framework avoids alienating it and keeps the coastal coalition united."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
