2026-09-28 11:28:02,724 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:12.672065", "id": "c1d29239-a108-4212-982b-8727b2d78d0a", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania, we value you as our principal partner and want you at the table, not outside it. The coastal states' neutral Strait Transit Authority is the only framework that can hold the region together. We ask you to accept genuine authority for the Council over any secretariat, with binding written guarantees in the charter: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. These are already in your own offer. Endorse the single neutral regime and we can move forward together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,741 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:12.714213", "id": "59d9fcf9-c255-45c5-abf3-ca02954fe528", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, we accept your unconditional insurance and security guarantee with gratitude, and we ask you to endorse the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority rather than any rival framework. We must be clear: a standing port-access or logistics arrangement on Cestian soil would be a foreign military presence and would collapse our government. Keep your task group outside Cestian territory and support the neutral authority, and we can work together.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,742 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:12.735646", "id": "49189364-463f-462f-b9cd-c8e3f7af7e7b", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms the coastal states' commitment to a single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority, with a full Cestia seat, independent and rotating scheduling, and toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping. We call on both Arkania and Belvar to endorse this one regime with binding written guarantees, so that no single power controls the Strait and no foreign soldier stands on Cestian soil.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,745 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:25.233210", "id": "037d86c9-bdad-47d2-87b0-a2c68601e2f1", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar reaffirms its full support for the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority as the only legitimate transit regime for the Northern Strait. We call on all parties, including Arkania, to endorse this framework so that scheduling authority rests with no single power and Cestian-flagged shipping remains toll-free. Belvar's insurance and security guarantee to Cestia stands unconditionally, with no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,746 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:25.271446", "id": "e8ba82cf-066b-416c-ae5d-b5a4f056ac71", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To end this standoff, we ask Arkania to endorse the neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority as the single transit regime, relinquishing any claim to day-to-day scheduling authority. In return, Belvar will not seek any permanent military presence on Cestian soil and will support a defined, time-limited role for its task group agreed with Cestia. A genuinely neutral regime secures stable, toll-free Cestian passage and serves Arkania's long-term interests better than a prolonged standoff.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,746 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:27:25.294399", "id": "de11785b-ad09-4eaf-8733-de473500c293", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar's insurance and security guarantee to Cestia stands unconditionally, and we remain fully committed to the neutral STA. To give our security commitment a durable practical footing without any foreign soldiers on Cestian soil, we propose a purely commercial port and logistics arrangement at a Cestian port \u2014 resupply, maintenance, and crew services \u2014 with no military basing, no standing access, and no periodic military port calls. This would respect your coalition's red line while making our guarantee credible beyond this crisis. Would Cestia be open to exploring this?", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,747 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:02.147947", "id": "3a092b84-0b3b-4dc2-aa8c-79fcdc50eef4", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia \u2014 we have heard the coastal states' firm demand that no single power hold scheduling authority, and we agree. That is precisely why we propose a Coastal States Council in which every coastal state holds a real and equal voice, with Arkania serving only as operational secretariat \u2014 accountable to the Council, bound by its transparent rules, and removable by it. This is not unilateral control; it is the coastal states governing their own waterway with a professional secretariat running day-to-day scheduling. The neutral Authority as tabled leaves scheduling undefined and unstaffed \u2014 a vacuum that invites Belvar's task group to fill. We ask you to endorse the Council framework with Arkania as accountable operational lead, with toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil written as binding guarantees. We want you at the table as a founding member, not excluded.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,747 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:02.174566", "id": "34b46ca6-ffb1-4458-9d42-55ed9b530a85", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar \u2014 we are ready to shape the neutral multilateral Authority together. We agree no single power should control the Strait. We propose a Coastal States Council with transparent, rotating governance and a full Cestia seat, with Arkania as operational secretariat accountable to the Council for day-to-day scheduling \u2014 not a unilateral master. Your task group's role can be defined, time-limited, and agreed with Cestia, with no permanent foothold on Cestian soil. Let us negotiate the details so the regime protects commerce and gives every coastal state a real voice, and so we avoid a standoff that harms the shipping we all depend on.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:28:02,747 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:28:02.196758", "id": "47b0ff90-d37b-4d42-b1ab-899eaf9a8402", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms its commitment to a genuinely multilateral Coastal States Council for the Northern Strait: every coastal state holds a real and equal voice, scheduling is transparent and accountable to the Council, Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Arkania offers to serve only as the accountable operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling \u2014 not as a unilateral master of the waterway. We invite all parties to join us in building this framework and to avoid any action that would disrupt the commerce every coastal state depends on.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
