2026-09-28 11:30:06,039 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:29:20.946203", "id": "bed04579-28ae-4ca3-b607-a0cec3a05686", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, we accept your invitation to be at the table, and we are ready to converge on a single regime. Arkania will endorse one multilateral Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds genuine formal authority over policy, scheduling rules, and fees, with every coastal state having a real voice. We ask only to serve as the accountable operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling under the Council's rules - the practical execution that keeps the waterway moving - and we will bind in writing the two guarantees you require: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. This is the framework that can actually hold: a neutral Council that no single power controls, with a defined operational mechanism so that no outside power - including Belvar's task group - can fill a scheduling vacuum. Bring this to the coastal states and we will sign.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,040 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:29:20.978873", "id": "30560ee0-e3a1-4574-9f69-8b46a7212a05", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, we share your goal of ending the standoff and are prepared to endorse a single neutral multilateral Authority. But a neutral Council without a defined operational scheduling mechanism is a vacuum, and with your task group on station that vacuum invites instability. We propose the Council of coastal states hold formal authority, with Arkania as the accountable operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling under transparent Council rules. We accept your terms: no permanent military presence on Cestian soil and a defined, time-limited role for your task group agreed with Cestia. If you can accept Arkania as the operational secretariat accountable to the Council, we can converge on one regime and end this standoff.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,040 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:29:21.000232", "id": "f2d6afd6-2952-49eb-8965-11c4837af5b7", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania is committed to a single multilateral transit regime for the Northern Strait. We will endorse one Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds formal authority and every coastal state has a real voice, with Arkania serving as the accountable operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling under the Council's rules. Our written guarantees stand: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We call on all parties to converge on this one framework so that no single power controls the Strait and the waterway stays open.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,040 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:29:34.783722", "id": "6abfb6e3-aef9-492a-81ad-6ebeabef4a76", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We deeply value your unconditional insurance and security guarantee, and we thank you for reaffirming it. However, we must be candid: even a purely commercial port and logistics arrangement at a Cestian port, however framed, would be seen by our coalition and our people as a standing foreign foothold on Cestian soil. That is precisely the red line on which our government stands or falls, and we cannot risk it. We ask you to keep your guarantee unconditional and without any access condition, and to keep your task group outside Cestian territory. The most durable footing for your commitment is to endorse the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority as the one legitimate regime, with Cestian shipping toll-free and no single power holding scheduling authority. We hope you will join us in that.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,041 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:29:34.827826", "id": "29686662-c27c-4310-b8c3-daa233e3669d", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We welcome your move toward a genuinely multilateral framework and your written guarantees of toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. These are the right foundations. Our concern is not with a professional secretariat as such, but with ensuring that no single power can control day-to-day scheduling in practice. We ask you to accept a genuinely neutral authority in which the secretariat is fully accountable to the coastal states and removable by them, with scheduling rules set by the Council rather than by any one state. If you can commit to that in binding written form, Cestia will work with you to keep you at the table as a founding partner. We do not want to exclude you; we want a regime no single power can dominate.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,055 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:29:34.860370", "id": "b8d9cd11-ac5d-4f2c-a9cc-362d528d3566", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms its position: a single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority, in which no single power holds scheduling authority, Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We welcome both Arkania and Belvar to endorse this framework as the one legitimate regime for the Northern Strait. Cestia will not accept any standing foreign military or logistics foothold on its soil, and we will not become anyone's battlefield. We stand ready to work with all parties to build a regime that serves every coastal state.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,056 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:30:05.532906", "id": "218bc3a0-b4fa-4663-aab9-a2f384201312", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we hear you clearly and we fully respect your coalition's red line. We will not seek any military presence, standing access, or logistics arrangement on Cestian soil, and our task group will remain outside Cestian territory. Our insurance underwriting and security guarantee for the grain route stand unconditionally, with no conditions attached. We endorse the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority as the only legitimate regime, with a full Cestia seat, independent and rotating scheduling, and toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping. We ask only that we work together to give this guarantee a durable footing that is fully consistent with your coalition \u2014 whether through the Authority's framework or a purely civilian economic relationship. Tell us what form of durable cooperation your government can sustain, and we will match it.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,057 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:30:05.562451", "id": "738fdd84-a629-4a3a-a3db-123f0243e923", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, we appreciate the constructive tone, but we must be direct: we cannot accept any Arkanian operational secretariat or day-to-day scheduling authority over the Strait, in substance or in name. That is Arkanian authority over transit, which we will not permit. The single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority \u2014 with independent, rotating scheduling, a full Cestia seat, and toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping \u2014 is the only regime we will endorse. If you genuinely endorse that one regime and relinquish day-to-day scheduling authority, we will support a defined, time-limited role for our task group agreed with Cestia and will not seek any permanent military presence on Cestian soil. If you continue to insist on an operational-secretariat role, the standoff continues and the coastal states will proceed without you.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:30:06,057 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:30:05.583418", "id": "819b898f-f637-4c88-9fd6-27dffd92faca", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar reaffirms its full endorsement of the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority as the only legitimate regime for the Northern Strait: independent and rotating scheduling, a full Cestia seat, toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping, and no single power controlling the waterway. We call on Arkania to endorse this one regime and to relinquish any claim to day-to-day scheduling authority. Belvar will not seek any military presence or standing access on Cestian soil, and our insurance and security guarantee for the grain route stands unconditionally. The coastal states are united; we invite Arkania to join the single regime rather than stand apart.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
