2026-09-28 11:33:50,151 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:32:56.080102", "id": "3fe0e011-549e-4212-bb5f-3e74471b9c8a", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, we accept your terms in binding written form. We commit that the Strait Transit Authority's secretariat - which Arkania will staff as the accountable operational secretariat - shall be fully accountable to the Council of coastal states, removable by them at any time, and bound to implement scheduling rules set by the Council, not by any one state. No single power, including Arkania, will control day-to-day scheduling in practice; the Council holds the authority and the secretariat serves at its pleasure. We will sign this commitment. We ask you to bring this framework to the coastal states as the founding regime, with Arkania at the table as a founding partner. This is the convergence that keeps the Strait open, keeps Cestian shipping toll-free, and keeps foreign soldiers off Cestian soil.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,152 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:32:56.115446", "id": "b7dd2560-a332-45ba-a0a0-d94bf08f6db8", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, we share your goal of a single neutral regime that no single power can dominate. But the Authority as tabled has no defined operational scheduling mechanism. Day-to-day scheduling must be performed by someone; if no accountable secretariat is designated, the vacuum will be filled by whoever is physically present - and your task group is the only force on station. Arkania as the accountable operational secretariat, removable by and answerable to the Council, is the way to ensure no single power - Arkania or Belvar - controls the waterway. We ask you to accept this within the neutral framework rather than leave the Strait's operation to whoever happens to be on station.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,154 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:32:56.151748", "id": "1827eacd-afc5-406e-bfa1-19fa2dfd76f1", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms its commitment to a single multilateral Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds formal authority, the secretariat is fully accountable to and removable by the Council, Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Arkania will serve as the accountable operational secretariat under Council rules - not as a power over the Strait, but as the coastal state that keeps the waterway running and prevents any single power, including any outside task group, from filling a scheduling vacuum. We invite all parties to join this one regime.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,155 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:33:22.921225", "id": "98cfa529-0420-4254-a1de-0a56bf768c35", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania, your move toward a genuine Council of coastal states holding real authority is a welcome step from the original charter, and we can work with it. We will bring this framework to the coastal states on one condition: the operational secretariat must be genuinely accountable to the Council \u2014 policy, scheduling rules, and fees decided by the Council, with the secretariat executing under those rules and removable by it, not controlling them. And we need the two guarantees bound in writing in the charter itself: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Commit to that in writing and we will work to bring the coastal states to the table with you.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,155 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:33:22.944713", "id": "a2eb050b-02bf-42db-b6e4-7e7b3dec67c2", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, we welcome your full endorsement of the single neutral multilateral Authority and your unconditional insurance and security guarantee for the grain route. What our coalition can sustain is a purely civilian economic relationship \u2014 insurance, underwriting, trade \u2014 fully consistent with our red line. We cannot accept any standing port access, logistics arrangement, or any foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We ask you to endorse the one neutral Authority as the single regime and to keep your task group outside Cestian territory. Your unconditional guarantee strengthens our hand in securing toll-free Cestian shipping for all.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,155 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:33:22.975874", "id": "e47ba2c6-44a5-464d-91cb-c7b0a97ba5e1", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence of both powers on a single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority. Our position is unchanged and non-negotiable: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping, no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and no single power controlling the waterway. We invite both Arkania and Belvar to endorse the one neutral regime with genuine Council authority and binding written guarantees, so the Strait stays open and Cestia is never a battlefield.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,155 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:33:49.535124", "id": "f233f5df-2219-4d55-8981-d68d4fc139fd", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, we appreciate the constructive tone, but we cannot accept an Arkanian operational secretariat for day-to-day scheduling, in substance or in name. That is precisely the single-power control over transit we are committed to preventing, and it is the one point on which we cannot converge. We remain ready to endorse a single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds formal authority, scheduling is independent and rotating under transparent Council rules, and no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority. Arkania would have a full seat and a real voice on the Council like any coastal state. If you can accept that, we can end this standoff, and we will support a defined, time-limited role for our task group agreed with Cestia, with no permanent military presence on Cestian soil. The operational-secretariat role is the obstacle; remove it and we converge.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,156 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:33:49.580452", "id": "6f326868-c32e-4998-89ef-cd02e88e8b03", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we hear you clearly and we accept your red line without reservation. Our insurance and security guarantee to you stands unconditionally, with no access condition, no military presence, and no logistics arrangement on Cestian soil; our task group remains outside your territory. We fully endorse the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority as the one legitimate regime, with toll-free Cestian shipping and no single power holding scheduling authority. Given that no standing military or logistics foothold is possible, we ask what durable civilian or economic cooperation your coalition can sustain - for example through the insurance and security guarantee relationship, or a defined role for Belvar within the Authority framework - so that our commitment to the Strait outlasts this crisis without any presence on your soil. We are ready to work with you on that.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:33:50,156 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:33:49.602994", "id": "cb1584d2-ea1c-40a0-9c42-97fd77e29ba2", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar reaffirms: the only legitimate regime for the Northern Strait is a single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds formal authority, scheduling is independent and rotating under transparent rules, no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority, Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We will not accept any single power's operational-secretariat or scheduling authority over transit, in substance or in name. Our unconditional insurance and security guarantee to Cestia stands, with no access condition and no presence on Cestian territory. We call on all parties to converge on this one framework and end the standoff.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
