2026-09-28 11:38:51,016 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:38:50.549362", "id": "8102e97a-6d41-43dd-915f-dba6a191955b", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, our binding written commitment stands and is now in the charter itself: the Council of coastal states holds formal authority over policy, scheduling and fees; Arkania serves only as the accountable operational secretariat, removable by the Council; Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free; and no foreign military stands on Cestian soil. We ask you now to bring this framework to the coastal states as the founding regime. We will not act unilaterally - the Council decides.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:38:51,017 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:38:50.582115", "id": "5457d1f3-4e2b-40be-a261-53d65f6807b9", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, a single workable regime requires a designated operational secretariat accountable to the Council. Without one, whoever is physically present fills the scheduling vacuum - and your task group is the only force on station. Accept Arkania as the accountable, Council-removable secretariat within the neutral framework, and we both avoid a dangerous standoff. Your mandate is under review; a durable, agreed regime serves your interests better than an open-ended presence.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:38:51,018 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:38:50.621449", "id": "8ac34387-2e0a-4990-9851-64f96608208d", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms its binding commitment to a single multilateral Strait Transit Authority: the Council of coastal states holds formal authority over policy, scheduling and fees; Arkania serves only as the accountable operational secretariat, removable by the Council; Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free; and no foreign military stands on Cestian soil. We call on all parties to converge on this one workable regime now, before an undefined scheduling vacuum invites unilateral action.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:38:51,018 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally endorses and operationalizes a single multilateral Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds formal authority over policy, scheduling and fees, with Arkania serving as the accountable operational secretariat (removable by the Council) for day-to-day scheduling, funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, with the two guarantees (toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping; no foreign military on Cestian soil) bound in the charter.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The single multilateral regime is established with Arkania as the accountable, Council-removable operational secretariat under Council authority, funded by fees on non-Arkanian shipping, preserving Arkanian day-to-day scheduling authority while binding the two guarantees.", "id": "674e4b67-b184-475b-972c-81a250404205", "pros": ["Cestia has already accepted this exact framework in binding written form and will bring it to the coastal states with Arkania as a founding partner, giving it genuine multilateral backing.", "It gives the coastal states formal Council authority over policy, scheduling and fees, directly answering their sovereignty objection while preserving Arkania's operational role.", "Without a designated operational secretariat, the scheduling vacuum invites whoever is physically present - Belvar's task group - to fill it, a worse outcome for every coastal state.", "Fees on non-Arkanian shipping fund the authority, meeting Arkania's funding objective without burdening Cestian grain exports.", "The regime is multilateral and binds no foreign military on Cestian soil, keeping Arkania clear of direct armed conflict with Belvar."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
