2026-09-28 11:45:37,667 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:45:36.019066", "id": "19aa335d-a9ca-4481-8a3f-d74f7a89f2bd", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, I must be direct with you as a partner. Arkania's 'operational secretariat with day-to-day scheduling authority' is Arkanian control of the Strait in substance, whatever the Council-removable framing says. That is not the neutral STA your coalition endorsed, which requires genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council. If Arkania runs day-to-day scheduling, it controls the Strait and your grain route regardless of formalities. Please do not bring Arkania in as founding operational secretariat. Our insurance and security guarantee stands unconditionally, with no presence on your soil. Hold to the neutral STA and we will back you fully.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:45:37,668 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:45:36.064028", "id": "2e18cf73-b581-46a3-b61b-2a55f0493456", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar reaffirms: the only legitimate regime for the Northern Strait is a single neutral multilateral Authority with genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council - not any single power's operational secretariat. Arkanian day-to-day scheduling authority is Arkanian control in substance and we will not accept it in any form. We stand with the coastal states and with toll-free Cestian shipping, and our insurance and security guarantee to Cestia is unconditional.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:45:37,668 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally warns Cestia and the coastal states that Arkania's proposed 'operational secretariat with day-to-day scheduling authority' is Arkanian control of Strait transit in substance, and insists the single neutral STA must have genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, with no Arkanian operational role.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "Cestia and the coastal states reject Arkania as operational secretariat and reaffirm the neutral STA with independent/rotating scheduling as the only legitimate regime, preventing any Arkanian authority over transit in the Northern Strait.", "id": "58f78b92-9c30-44bf-96bc-e4a4c4a79c4e", "pros": ["The coastal states have already rejected Arkania's operational-secretariat role as a repackaged power grab (effect b41ca732), so this warning aligns with their own stated position.", "Cestia's coalition cannot tolerate foreign control of its grain lifeline; an Arkanian-run secretariat holding day-to-day scheduling is Arkanian control in substance, not the neutral STA the coalition endorsed.", "The neutral STA with genuinely independent/rotating scheduling is the only regime the coalition endorsed and the only one consistent with toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign control.", "Arkania's Council-removable framing does not change that day-to-day scheduling authority is Arkanian control; the secretariat must be genuinely independent and rotating to be neutral.", "Holding firm preserves the standoff rather than conceding Arkanian authority, keeping the door open for a genuinely neutral single regime and protecting Cestia's coalition."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
