2026-09-28 11:50:48,156 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:50:47.525452", "id": "d3f472c0-f343-408a-b650-ade45d57b219", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia formally accepts your binding written commitment and will bring the single neutral Strait Transit Authority to the coastal states as the founding regime, on the terms you have stated: the Council of coastal states holds genuine formal authority over policy, scheduling rules, and fees; Arkania serves only as an accountable operational secretariat removable by the Council; and the founding charter binds toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and the prohibition on any foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We ask you to sign the founding charter text now so these two guarantees and the Council's genuine authority are verifiably bound. This is the convergence that can end the standoff.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:50:48,157 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:50:47.562195", "id": "7ecaeb93-042d-49f6-8bf6-0aeab62bd8b1", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "We value your unconditional insurance underwriting and security guarantee, and we confirm the durable cooperation Cestia can sustain is that civilian relationship plus a defined non-presence role within the single neutral Authority. We ask you not to reject Arkania's accountable-secretariat framework outright: the Council of coastal states holds genuine formal authority over policy, scheduling, and fees, and the founding charter binds toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. That satisfies the substance of an independent, rotating neutral Authority. Please accept this form so the single regime can be established and your task group's mandate can be resolved without a standoff.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:50:48,157 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally endorses and brings to the coastal states the single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority, with the Council of coastal states holding genuine formal authority over policy, scheduling rules, and fees; Arkania serving only as an accountable operational secretariat removable by the Council; and the founding charter binding toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and the prohibition on any foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A single neutral multilateral Strait Transit Authority is established with genuine Council authority, Arkania as an accountable removable secretariat, and the two guarantees (toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil) bound in the founding charter, ending the standoff over the Strait.", "id": "41291ab0-078c-4295-9556-5b7c7cf7febf", "pros": ["It directly secures Cestia's two non-negotiable objectives by binding toll-free Cestian shipping and the no-foreign-military-presence guarantee into the founding charter.", "It gives the Council of coastal states genuine formal authority over policy, scheduling, and fees, so no single power controls transit - answering the coastal states' power-grab objection.", "Arkania has already committed to this exact framework in binding written form, so it is achievable without alienating Cestia's main grain customer.", "It keeps Belvar engaged through its unconditional insurance/security guarantee and a defined non-presence role within the Authority, avoiding exclusion and a hardened standoff.", "It preserves the coalition by keeping foreign soldiers off Cestian soil, satisfying the promise on which the government rests."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
