2026-09-28 11:55:55,652 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:14.689595", "id": "1d450b96-072d-4867-b310-297ebf119952", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "I have formally endorsed and brought to the coastal states the single neutral Strait Transit Authority with genuine Council authority, your role as accountable removable secretariat, and the two guarantees bound in the founding charter. To close this, I ask you to sign the founding charter text now, binding in writing: (1) genuine Council authority over policy, scheduling rules and fees, with you as accountable secretariat removable by the Council; (2) toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping; and (3) no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Your signature is the final step that lets the coastal states endorse this as the single regime and end the standoff.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,653 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:14.729493", "id": "aa2747f4-3b9e-499f-965e-76a9876dc520", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "I reaffirm the durable cooperation Cestia can sustain: your unconditional insurance underwriting and security guarantee, plus a defined non-presence role for you within the neutral Authority framework. No military presence, standing access, or logistics foothold on Cestian soil - that is fixed. I ask you to accept this civilian-only form and not to press Cestia to reject Arkania's accountable-secretariat role outright. The single neutral Authority with genuine Council authority and rotating scheduling is the outcome that serves us all; please help me hold the convergence together rather than harden the standoff.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,653 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:43.249172", "id": "0a34e1cd-403b-431a-824b-4b48af76b877", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, as a partner I accept your red line without reservation, and I confirm the durable cooperation we can build: the unconditional insurance and security guarantee, together with a defined non-presence role for Belvar within the Authority - for example independent oversight or verification of transparent scheduling. That gives our commitment a durable footing with no presence on your soil.\n\nBut I must be honest with you. Arkania as operational secretariat with day-to-day scheduling authority is Arkanian control of the Strait in substance, whatever the Council-removable framing says. That is not the neutral STA your coalition endorsed, and the coastal states have already rejected that exact role as a repackaged power grab. If Arkania runs day-to-day scheduling, it controls your grain route regardless of formalities. Please hold to genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, and do not bring Arkania in as founding operational secretariat. Our insurance and security guarantee stands unconditionally, and we will back you fully if you hold the line.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,654 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:43.314698", "id": "19128c4d-b2cc-443a-a23c-897e49adcc34", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, we can end this standoff on one basis: a single neutral Authority with genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, in which no single power - Arkania or Belvar - holds day-to-day scheduling authority. If you endorse that and relinquish the operational-secretariat role, Belvar will support a defined, time-limited role for its task group agreed with Cestia and will not seek any permanent military presence on Cestian soil. The operational-secretariat role is the sole obstacle; remove it and we converge on one regime.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,655 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:54:43.363562", "id": "670d9118-02d4-40ca-be8a-5acffb7e13cd", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar reaffirms: the only legitimate regime for the Northern Strait is a single neutral multilateral Authority with genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council - not any single power's operational secretariat. We stand with the coastal states, with toll-free Cestian shipping, and with no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Our insurance and security guarantee to Cestia is unconditional. We call on all parties to converge on this one neutral framework and end the standoff.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,655 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:55.185003", "id": "c42f2de2-ab0e-44fc-ada7-9f31a409c99f", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania formally signs and endorses the founding charter text. The two guarantees \u2014 Cestian-flagged shipping toll-free, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil \u2014 are bound in the charter itself, and genuine authority is vested in the Council of coastal states, with Arkania serving as the accountable operational secretariat, fully removable by the Council, with scheduling rules set by the Council. We ask Cestia to bring this founding regime to the coastal states now, with Arkania as founding partner, so the guarantees and Council authority are verifiably bound and the standoff over the Strait can end.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,656 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:55.224957", "id": "9a234d28-adb8-4d4a-81bb-cf4233e16837", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania is prepared to sign a single neutral multilateral Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds genuine authority and Arkania serves as the accountable, Council-removable operational secretariat. Without a designated operational mechanism, whoever is physically present \u2014 your task group \u2014 fills the scheduling vacuum, which serves no one. We ask Belvar to accept Arkania as the accountable secretariat within the neutral framework, in exchange for a defined, time-limited task-group role agreed with Cestia and no permanent foothold on Cestian soil. Your mandate is under review; a durable settlement now serves both our interests.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 11:55:55,656 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T09:55:55.244616", "id": "0111094c-0786-4f25-86a5-c220a841b4c3", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania reaffirms its commitment to a single multilateral regime: a Council of coastal states holding genuine authority, Arkania as the accountable and Council-removable operational secretariat, toll-free Cestian shipping, and no foreign military on Cestian soil \u2014 all bound in the founding charter. We call on all parties to converge on this single workable regime and end the standoff over the Strait.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
