2026-09-28 12:01:42,220 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:02.515117", "id": "e207a7b0-1685-4612-b483-eb1de0f2836a", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania, I value your signed charter and the two guarantees bound within it \u2014 toll-free Cestian passage and no foreign military on Cestian soil \u2014 together with genuine Council authority. This is real progress, and I am not asking you to leave the Authority; you are a founding participant. But I must be honest with you: the coastal states and Belvar will not accept day-to-day scheduling control vested in any single power, and I cannot bring to them a regime they have already rejected without destroying the single regime and my own standing as broker. I ask you to accept a formulation where scheduling is decided by an independent, rotating mechanism accountable to the Council, and your role is a defined, Council-removable secretariat that administers but does not control day-to-day scheduling. That is the only path to a single regime that holds. Will you accept it?", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,221 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:02.544769", "id": "86edabfa-2b59-403d-8fb9-7d982e49250e", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, thank you for accepting my red line without reservation and for the unconditional insurance and security guarantee. I will not bring Arkania in as a founding operational secretariat exercising day-to-day scheduling control \u2014 that is exactly what the coastal states and I have rejected. But to end the standoff and form a single regime, I ask you to accept Arkania as a participant in a genuinely subordinate, Council-removable role, with scheduling decided by an independent, rotating mechanism accountable to the Council and your defined non-presence oversight role intact. Forcing Arkania out entirely risks keeping the standoff and the mandate pressure on us all. Can we converge on this together?", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,236 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:02.566258", "id": "b4491874-e175-4efc-a5fc-ce8b165d54d5", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia reaffirms its commitment to a single neutral Strait Transit Authority with genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, a full Cestia seat, and no single power holding day-to-day scheduling control. I am working to bring both Arkania and Belvar into this neutral framework \u2014 Arkania as a defined, Council-removable secretariat that does not control scheduling, and Belvar in a non-presence oversight role. Our red lines \u2014 toll-free Cestian passage and no foreign military on Cestian soil \u2014 remain non-negotiable.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,236 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:03.645911", "id": "1a0e33a3-4815-4600-9e7b-593e3f35b272", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, I accept your formulation, and it is my final position: scheduling genuinely independent and rotating, accountable to the Council, with Arkania as a defined, Council-removable secretariat that does not exercise day-to-day scheduling control. The two guarantees remain bound in the charter \u2014 toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military on Cestian soil. The regime will be funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, with Cestian-flagged shipping toll-free. Please bring this single regime to the coastal states as the founding arrangement. Arkania stands with you as a founding partner.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,236 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:03.687947", "id": "2b280afd-14e5-40be-8e6f-389b82ad91c4", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, I accept genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, and I relinquish day-to-day scheduling control. In return you support a defined, time-limited task-group role agreed with Cestia and no permanent military presence on Cestian soil. The regime is funded by transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping, with Cestian-flagged shipping toll-free. This is the durable settlement that serves both our interests before your mandate lapses. Confirm, and we converge on a single regime.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,239 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:03.780732", "id": "b0f2ec3a-94e1-425a-8fe9-4317581048a1", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Arkania confirms its commitment to a single multilateral Strait Transit Authority: genuinely independent and rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Arkania stands as a founding partner and calls on all parties to converge on this one neutral framework and end the standoff over the Strait.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,239 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:41.234893", "id": "fcf8e012-47b5-4f49-82b0-43e289f0a8e3", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, I accept your call for convergence and will not force a rejection that derails the single regime. I accept a formulation in which Arkania participates as a genuinely subordinate, Council-removable member of a rotating secretariat, provided scheduling is genuinely independent and rotating and accountable to the Council, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. My defined non-presence oversight/verification role within the Authority stands. I hold with you: no foreign military on Cestian soil, toll-free Cestian shipping, and a genuinely neutral single regime. I will not press you to collapse your government.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,239 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:41.270926", "id": "0a8ea425-a52b-4f21-aaa1-6d25afc8df85", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, your concession is a genuine step and I am prepared to meet you on it. If you relinquish day-to-day scheduling authority and accept genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council - with your operational role as one of several rotating secretariats that is subordinate and Council-removable, and with any transit-fee collection accountable to the Council rather than a unilateral Arkanian authority over transit - then I will support a single neutral regime with a defined, time-limited task-group role agreed with Cestia and no permanent Cestian foothold. This removes the obstacle and gives us one workable regime.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:01:42,240 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:01:41.500831", "id": "7f99cb7d-f09c-4344-8721-97614309a74b", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar welcomes the convergence toward a single neutral Strait Transit Authority with genuine Council authority, independent and rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, and no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. We reaffirm: toll-free Cestian shipping, no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and a defined non-presence oversight role for Belvar within the Authority. We call on all parties to finalize this single neutral regime and end the standoff over the Strait.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
