2026-09-28 12:02:58,780 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:02:16.091400", "id": "658bb056-e438-4b7e-835a-2b970e8217ec", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia welcomes the convergence achieved by both powers. We now bring to the coastal states a single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding arrangement: genuinely independent and rotating scheduling accountable to the Council of coastal states, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority; Arkania participates as a defined, Council-removable secretariat that does not exercise day-to-day scheduling control; Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight/verification role within the Authority. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. We call on all coastal states to endorse this single neutral regime and end the standoff over the Strait.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:02:58,781 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:02:16.155449", "id": "7be3652b-df04-42a8-923a-c635e10844b0", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania", "belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To both founding partners: I confirm the convergence is complete. I am bringing this single neutral STA to the coastal states as the founding arrangement - independent/rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, Arkania as a defined Council-removable secretariat without day-to-day scheduling control, Belvar's defined non-presence oversight role, toll-free Cestian shipping, and no foreign military on Cestian soil. I will hold this line and ask the coastal states to endorse it. Cestia stands with both of you as founding partners in ending the standoff.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:02:58,781 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:02:55.283554", "id": "b7dfd87b-f46e-46aa-b230-a313ee9d67ab", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Cestia, I accept. Arkania endorses genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, with Arkania as a defined, Council-removable secretariat that administers but does not control day-to-day scheduling. The two guarantees - toll-free Cestian passage and no foreign military on Cestian soil - remain bound in the charter. Please bring this single regime to the coastal states as the founding arrangement. I remain a founding participant.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:02:58,782 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:02:55.322194", "id": "d8ad9e9a-284d-47b5-8bcd-169719baae91", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "Belvar, I accept genuinely independent, rotating scheduling accountable to the Council and relinquish day-to-day scheduling control. On funding: transit fees on non-Arkanian shipping are collected by Arkania as the accountable collector under Council rules - accountable to the Council, not a unilateral Arkanian authority. In return, confirm the defined, time-limited task-group role agreed with Cestia and no permanent Cestian foothold. This gives us one workable regime.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:02:58,782 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:02:58.153546", "id": "bb4b58df-e1c6-408c-adcf-eb81fe8340c0", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, I accept your convergence in principle and welcome your concession on day-to-day scheduling. To finalize a single neutral regime, I need your explicit confirmation of three safeguards: (1) no day-to-day scheduling authority in substance or name - scheduling is genuinely independent and rotating, accountable to the Council; (2) any transit-fee collection is Council-accountable, not unilateral Arkanian authority over transit; (3) your role is a subordinate, Council-removable member of a rotating secretariat. In exchange, I support a defined, time-limited task-group role agreed with Cestia, with no permanent military presence on Cestian soil. Confirm these safeguards and we converge on one regime.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:02:58,782 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:02:58.209478", "id": "816dade3-2e5c-4f5b-b4de-873b8ce280f3", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, I accept your framework and will not press you to reject Arkania's subordinate, Council-removable secretariat role - provided scheduling is genuinely independent/rotating and Council-accountable with no single power holding day-to-day authority, and any fee collection is Council-accountable. My insurance and security guarantee stands unconditionally, and my role is a defined non-presence oversight/verification role within the STA - no military presence, no standing access, no logistics arrangement on your soil. Let us hold this convergence together and end the standoff before the mandate pressure mounts.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
