2026-09-28 12:13:49,782 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:13:48.471309", "id": "ee072700-3abc-43e6-9aaa-96726449fe19", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, our convergence is complete and I confirm it in full. Belvar's insurance and security guarantee to you stands unconditionally, with no military presence, no standing access, and no logistics arrangement on your soil. I will take up the defined non-presence oversight/verification role within the single neutral Strait Transit Authority, and our task group remains outside your territory on a defined, time-limited footing agreed with you. We will hold this line together.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:13:49,783 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:13:48.495189", "id": "5333d527-1dbb-41b4-b00b-f3bcb6489f63", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Arkania, I accept your written confirmation of the safeguards and confirm the closed deal: the single neutral STA with genuinely independent/rotating, Council-accountable scheduling, your subordinate Council-removable rotating-secretariat role, and Council-accountable fee collection. In return I confirm the defined, time-limited task-group role agreed with Cestia and no permanent Cestian foothold. We expect the Authority to remain genuinely Council-accountable in practice.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:13:49,784 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formalizes its durable, non-presence footing in the Strait: it finalizes the unconditional civilian insurance/security guarantee to Cestia and takes up its defined oversight/verification role within the single neutral Strait Transit Authority, while keeping its task group on a defined, time-limited footing agreed with Cestia and outside Cestian territory.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "Belvar secures a durable foothold in the Northern Strait that outlasts the crisis without a permanent fleet or any foreign military presence on Cestian soil, while the single neutral STA remains genuinely Council-accountable with no Arkanian authority over transit and no open-ended Belvar deployment.", "id": "b1992bb2-79b3-4fb7-8b92-cbc3ff73e653", "pros": ["Respects Cestia's absolute coalition red line against any foreign military presence or logistics arrangement on its soil, keeping the Cestian government stable and the whole settlement viable.", "The unconditional insurance/security guarantee gives Cestia economic and security certainty, binding it durably to Belvar as the credible guarantor of the grain route.", "The defined, time-limited task-group role avoids an open-ended deployment, consistent with the mandate lapsing after turn 4 and with domestic limits on prolonged presence.", "The neutral STA with genuinely independent/rotating, Council-accountable scheduling and Arkania's subordinate, Council-removable secretariat role prevents any Arkanian authority over transit.", "A defined non-presence oversight/verification role gives Belvar a credible, durable stake in the regime without basing, satisfying the standing-access objective in its achievable form."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 3}
