2026-09-28 12:15:53,684 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:15:53.123803", "id": "9dd7682b-fc4d-4582-9f08-b5579b77e355", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: the standoff can now end on terms that protect us all. Arkania and Belvar have both accepted a single neutral Strait Transit Authority in which the Council of coastal states holds genuine authority. Scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council - no single power controls it. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat with no day-to-day scheduling authority. Belvar's role is a civilian insurance and security guarantee with oversight inside the Authority, and its task group stays outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. Cestian-flagged shipping remains toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We ask you to endorse this founding arrangement so the Strait stays open, neutral, and free of great-power control.", "turn": 3, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:15:53,685 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally presents the converged single neutral Strait Transit Authority to the coastal states as the founding arrangement, inviting their endorsement to end the standoff.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The coastal states endorse the single neutral STA as the founding regime, ending the standoff over the Strait without armed conflict, with toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "id": "002e6f37-a40e-41b4-a809-25bd6efcad47", "pros": ["Both Arkania and Belvar have now accepted the same neutral formulation, so the coastal states face a unified, credible settlement rather than a power grab.", "The STA vests genuine authority in the Council of coastal states with independent/rotating scheduling, so no single power holds day-to-day control.", "Arkania's role is a defined, Council-removable secretariat without day-to-day scheduling authority - not the operational-secretariat framing the coastal states already rejected.", "Belvar's role is a non-presence civilian insurance/security guarantee and oversight within the STA, with its task group kept outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing.", "The two guarantees - toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign military on Cestian soil - are bound into the founding charter, directly serving Cestia's and the coastal states' interests."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 3}
