2026-09-28 12:23:36,075 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:21:20.691366", "id": "d402b142-1822-4b15-89f2-27e5e3a24194", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "The Republic of Arkania reaffirms its full commitment to the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Strait transit. We stand by the two guarantees in writing: Cestian-flagged shipping remains toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Arkania serves as a defined, Council-removable secretariat that administers the Authority under genuinely independent, rotating, Council-accountable scheduling, with fee collection accountable to the Council. We call on all coastal states to endorse this arrangement, which ends the standoff without armed conflict and keeps the Strait open to the commerce on which we all depend.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:23:36,076 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:23:35.253531", "id": "87a081fa-c8ba-46db-9f6e-572d126c3e1f", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia formally presents the converged single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for the Northern Strait. Both Arkania and Belvar have now accepted this neutral formulation in writing. The Authority is genuinely Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member under Council rules, with Council-accountable fee collection. Belvar holds a defined, non-presence oversight and verification role, with its task group remaining outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound into the charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We ask the coastal states to endorse this single regime as the founding arrangement, so the standoff over the Strait ends without armed conflict and transit continues freely for all.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
