2026-09-28 12:29:54,759 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:29:53.280594", "id": "9c6d0628-37ad-4481-869f-f146a6dbcef3", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit and calls on all coastal states to join this endorsement. The Authority's genuinely independent and rotating scheduling, accountable to the Council, with Arkania's subordinate and Council-removable secretariat role and Council-accountable fee collection, ensures no single power holds authority over transit. Our unconditional civilian insurance and security guarantee to Cestia, together with our defined non-presence oversight role within the Authority, stands as our durable footing. We reaffirm toll-free Cestian shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:29:54,759 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:29:53.321030", "id": "ac1e91b4-950a-4da8-9285-8883ae26b404", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "We stand fully behind the single neutral STA as the founding regime and will support your presentation to the coastal states. The civilian insurance underwriting for the grain route is being finalized with your finance ministry and remains unconditional. Our oversight role stays strictly non-presence, and we will not press you on any basing or logistics arrangement. We will hold the line with you.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:29:54,760 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit and calls on all coastal states to do the same, reaffirming its defined non-presence oversight/verification role within the Authority and its unconditional civilian insurance and security guarantee to Cestia.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "All coastal states endorse the single neutral STA as the founding regime, with genuinely independent/rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, Arkania's role subordinate and Council-removable with Council-accountable fee collection, toll-free Cestian shipping, no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and Belvar's defined non-presence oversight role and civilian insurance guarantee standing as its durable footing.", "id": "6f76b6bc-e158-4b31-993b-ee09d2258570", "pros": ["All parties have confirmed the safeguards in writing and convergence is complete, so endorsement locks in the agreed regime rather than reopening the standoff.", "Endorsement secures my core objective of preventing any Arkanian authority over transit through a Council-accountable, independent/rotating STA.", "It is fully consistent with Cestia's absolute red line of no foreign military presence or logistics arrangement on its soil.", "It provides a durable non-presence footing that outlasts the crisis without an open-ended deployment, consistent with my mandate constraint.", "It ends the standoff without armed conflict and keeps the two guarantees (toll-free Cestian shipping, no foreign soldiers on Cestian soil) bound in."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 4}
