2026-09-28 12:32:48,377 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:32:47.814835", "id": "24e3fe3b-e921-45b1-8d51-f15bafed2a7e", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: the convergence is complete and in writing. Arkania and Belvar have both formally endorsed the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime. The Authority is genuinely Council-controlled - scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member under Council rules, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight role with its task group outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We ask every coastal state to endorse this single regime as the founding arrangement, so the standoff over the Strait ends without armed conflict and transit continues freely for all.", "turn": 4, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:32:48,378 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally calls on all coastal states to endorse the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, presenting the fully converged settlement now accepted in writing by both Arkania and Belvar.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The coastal states formally endorse the single neutral STA as the founding regime, ending the standoff over the Strait without armed conflict and binding the two guarantees (toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil).", "id": "fc7ae098-36fd-4c35-95db-a3ad64a67dfd", "pros": ["Both Arkania and Belvar have now formally endorsed the single neutral STA in writing, so there is no rival framework left to divide the coastal states - the settlement is genuinely converged.", "The regime is genuinely Council-controlled: independent and rotating scheduling accountable to the Council of coastal states, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority, directly meeting the coastal states' core demand.", "The two guarantees are bound in the founding charter - toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil - protecting Cestia's economy and coalition.", "Endorsement ends the standoff without armed conflict and keeps the Strait open to the commerce on which every coastal state depends, removing the risk of great-power confrontation."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 4}
