2026-09-28 12:34:52,464 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:34:39.753042", "id": "0cd98053-a9e0-4e73-bd31-d79e23698294", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: the convergence is complete and in writing. Arkania and Belvar have both formally endorsed the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for the Northern Strait. The Authority is genuinely Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member under Council rules, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight role with its task group outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We ask every coastal state to formally endorse this single regime as the founding arrangement, so the standoff over the Strait ends without armed conflict and transit continues freely for all. Cestia stands ready to work with each of you to finalize the endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:34:52,465 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:34:39.796664", "id": "06fd115e-0af0-4a47-a926-16509994126e", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania, thank you for your formal endorsement of the single neutral STA as the founding regime. Your written commitment to the two guarantees and to a defined, Council-removable secretariat role without day-to-day scheduling control is what makes convergence possible. I am now pressing the coastal states to endorse this single regime. I ask you to help me hold this line and reassure the coastal states that your role is genuinely subordinate and Council-accountable, so we can close the standoff together. Cestia values you as our principal grain market and wants you at the table as a founding partner.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:34:52,465 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:34:39.831687", "id": "34f4e144-9e12-40f3-8e74-e73442fbf016", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, thank you for your formal endorsement of the single neutral STA and for your unconditional civilian insurance and security guarantee to Cestia. Your defined non-presence oversight role and your task group's time-limited footing outside Cestian territory are exactly the durable cooperation our coalition can sustain. I am now pressing the coastal states to endorse the single regime. I ask you to help me hold this line and reassure the coastal states that the settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled, so we can end the standoff before your mandate pressure mounts. We will hold the line together.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:34:52,465 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:34:51.842385", "id": "8b9fd4a5-93c0-46ca-8eb3-22cc73b0c6ba", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 to close the loop with your finance ministry: Belvar's underwriting of the grain route's insurance stands unconditionally, as committed, and is not conditioned on any basing or access arrangement. We are ready to finalize the terms this week. Separately, we confirm our task group remains on a defined, time-limited footing entirely outside Cestian territory, consistent with your coalition's red line and with our own commitment to avoid an open-ended deployment. We will hold the single neutral STA as the founding regime and our non-presence oversight/verification role within it.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:34:52,465 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:34:51.875051", "id": "7919292f-6e18-4b51-8906-bc9761536330", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar reaffirms the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the unanimously endorsed founding regime for Northern Strait transit. Our unconditional civilian insurance/security guarantee to Cestia stands, our oversight/verification role within the STA is non-presence, and our task group remains on a defined, time-limited footing outside Cestian territory. We call on all coastal states to hold this line and to keep the Authority genuinely Council-accountable.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
