2026-09-28 12:35:49,559 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:35:32.369177", "id": "d3209869-688b-403f-9b13-b97eb4a98d63", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To the coastal states: Arkania formally reaffirms the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. Our role is defined and subordinate - a Council-removable secretariat that administers under Council rules and holds no day-to-day scheduling authority. Scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states. Fee collection is Council-accountable, applied only to non-Arkanian shipping, and Cestian-flagged shipping remains toll-free. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, and toll-free Cestian transit. We call on every coastal state to endorse this single regime so the standoff ends without armed conflict and transit continues freely for all. Arkania stands ready to work with each of you to finalize the endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:35:49,559 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:35:38.900717", "id": "74f299eb-269f-4854-8c1c-4594971fcaf6", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we hold the line together. Belvar's formal endorsement of the single neutral STA as the founding regime stands, and our unconditional civilian insurance and security guarantee to you is firm and ready to be finalized with your finance ministry. Our task group remains outside Cestian territory on a defined, time-limited footing - no foreign military presence on your soil, no standing access, no logistics arrangement. We will reassure the coastal states that this settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled, and we will not let any rival framework reopen the standoff. Count on us through the final turn.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:35:49,559 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:35:38.927004", "id": "0aa582b6-14dc-48c5-ada5-d4468163bd20", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the coastal states: Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for the Northern Strait, and we urge every coastal state to do the same. This settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member under Council rules, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight role with its task group outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and keeps transit free for all. We stand ready to work with each of you to finalize the endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:35:49,560 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:35:48.813468", "id": "aaba5e31-0557-489f-b4c4-ed05aefee515", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 thank you. We accept your confirmation and are ready to finalize the insurance underwriting terms with our finance ministry this week, on the clear understanding that the guarantee is unconditional and carries no basing, access, or standing-logistics condition. Your task group's defined, time-limited footing entirely outside Cestian territory is consistent with our coalition's red line, and we appreciate your holding it. We will continue to hold the single neutral STA as the founding regime and your non-presence oversight/verification role within it.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:35:49,560 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:35:48.851130", "id": "f7623423-8816-4cb6-8e20-7992d1e5b6be", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the unanimously endorsed founding regime for Northern Strait transit. Both guarantees are bound in the founding charter: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping, and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. The Authority is genuinely Council-accountable, with independent/rotating scheduling and no single power holding day-to-day control. We call on all coastal states to formally endorse this single regime as the founding arrangement, so the standoff over the Strait ends for good and our grain trade continues without disruption.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
