2026-09-28 12:36:43,790 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:36:39.517129", "id": "acdde11d-10f7-40dc-ac06-58f40c937961", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 agreed, and thank you. We are ready to finalize the insurance underwriting terms with your finance ministry this week. To be explicit and on the record: the guarantee is unconditional and carries no basing, access, or standing-logistics condition of any kind. Our task group remains on its defined, time-limited footing entirely outside Cestian territory, consistent with your coalition's red line. We will continue to hold the single neutral STA as the founding regime and our non-presence oversight/verification role within it. We stand with you to hold the line through final endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:36:43,790 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:36:39.577373", "id": "34cf3026-a7f2-4dc3-b5f3-a34452397879", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the coastal states: Belvar formally reaffirms the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. The two guarantees are bound in the founding charter \u2014 toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. The Authority is genuinely Council-accountable, with independent/rotating scheduling and no single power holding day-to-day control. We call on every coastal state to formally endorse this single regime so the standoff ends for good and transit continues freely for all. Belvar's role remains civilian and non-presence: an unconditional insurance/security guarantee to Cestia and a defined oversight/verification role within the STA, with our task group on a time-limited footing outside Cestian territory.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:36:43,791 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:36:42.660768", "id": "08178aff-2435-4bf5-9339-2e21e80ad85c", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, and we call on every coastal state to do the same. This settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states, with no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member under Council rules, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight role with its task group outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and keeps transit free for all. We stand ready to work with each of you to finalize the endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:36:43,791 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:36:42.693760", "id": "2f1bae70-3ba1-47f6-a630-586d2d29bc7a", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar, thank you for holding the line with us. We confirm our finance ministry is ready to finalize the insurance underwriting terms this week, consistent with our shared red line: no military presence, no standing access, no logistics arrangement on Cestian soil. Your unconditional civilian insurance and security guarantee, and your defined non-presence oversight role within the single neutral STA, are exactly what keeps this settlement genuinely neutral and Council-controlled. We will continue to press the coastal states for their endorsement of the single regime. Count on us through the final turn.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
