2026-09-28 12:37:33,223 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:37:18.258816", "id": "a084f9e6-ca67-401a-92a4-ac4b3dd52ab5", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 agreed, and thank you for putting the terms on the record. We will finalize the insurance underwriting with our finance ministry this week on exactly those terms: unconditional, with no basing, access, or standing-logistics condition of any kind. We hold the single neutral STA as the founding regime and your non-presence oversight/verification role within it. We stand with you to hold the line through final endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:37:33,224 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:37:18.320234", "id": "b009f359-b97c-4e63-a0a3-f1ce475b5ccb", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia calls on every coastal state to formally endorse the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. Both powers have now bound themselves to the two guarantees in the founding charter \u2014 toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. The Authority is genuinely Council-accountable: independent/rotating scheduling, no single power holding day-to-day control, and a full Cestia seat. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff for good and keeps transit free for all. Cestia stands ready to work with each of you to finalize the founding arrangement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:37:33,224 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:37:32.326816", "id": "1f37f9da-def7-45a3-b460-ac2b46835677", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, thank you. We are ready to finalize the insurance underwriting terms with your finance ministry this week, on the clear understanding the guarantee is unconditional and carries no military presence, no standing access, and no logistics arrangement on Cestian soil. Our civilian insurance and security guarantee, and our defined non-presence oversight role within the single neutral STA, stand exactly as agreed. We will hold the line with you through the final turn and keep pressing the coastal states to endorse the single regime.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:37:33,224 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:37:32.361814", "id": "8a0c9e2a-7cb0-4bd9-b630-df3449195848", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the coastal states: Belvar reaffirms its formal endorsement of the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. This settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating and accountable to the Council, no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority, Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight role with its task group outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound in the charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. We call on every coastal state to endorse this single regime and end the standoff without armed conflict.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
