2026-09-28 12:38:07,806 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:38:05.543361", "id": "7a303af4-d3b8-4a53-a2eb-b9ef59697603", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia calls on every coastal state to formally endorse the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. Both Arkania and Belvar have now put their formal endorsement on record. The settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating and accountable to the Council, no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority, Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight role with its task group outside Cestian territory on a time-limited footing. The two guarantees are bound in the founding charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and secures free, reliable transit for all of us. Cestia stands ready to finalize the founding arrangement with you.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:38:07,807 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:38:06.986396", "id": "d98ef6bd-7733-4e6e-b930-465a42adb4ae", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 agreed, and thank you. We are ready to finalize the insurance underwriting with your finance ministry this week on exactly the terms on record: unconditional, with no basing, access, or standing-logistics condition of any kind. Our civilian insurance/security guarantee stands, and our oversight/verification role within the single neutral STA is fixed. We will hold the line with you through final endorsement.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:38:07,807 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:38:07.025860", "id": "856e734d-ee75-4ec0-8c14-319f5cc1db5b", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the coastal states: Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit and calls on every coastal state to do the same. Both powers are bound in the founding charter to the two guarantees \u2014 toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. The Authority is genuinely Council-accountable: independent/rotating scheduling, no single power holding day-to-day control, and a full Cestia seat. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff for good and keeps transit free for all.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
