2026-09-28 12:40:24,760 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:40:24.212127", "id": "e915819b-4005-44cc-aa44-c57c089104ad", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To the coastal states: Arkania formally reaffirms its endorsement of the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, and we join Cestia and Belvar in calling on every coastal state to do the same. This settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating and accountable to the Council, with no single power holding day-to-day control. Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat member under Council rules, and its fee collection on non-Arkanian shipping is fully Council-accountable. The two guarantees are bound in the founding charter: Cestian-flagged shipping is toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and keeps transit free and reliable for all of us. Arkania stands ready to finalize the founding arrangement with each of you.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:40:24,761 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania formally reaffirms its endorsement of the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime and calls on all remaining coastal states to formally endorse it, confirming Arkania's subordinate, Council-removable secretariat role and Council-accountable fee collection on non-Arkanian shipping.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "All coastal states formally endorse the single neutral STA as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, closing the standoff without armed conflict and locking in the two guarantees (toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil).", "id": "931ae280-4215-4e4b-a0c3-15aa322f011a", "pros": ["Arkania, Belvar, and Cestia have all already formally endorsed the single neutral STA, so the regime is unanimously agreed among the principals and no rival framework remains on the table.", "The founding charter binds the two guarantees and genuine Council accountability (independent/rotating scheduling, no single power holding day-to-day control), giving every coastal state a clear, neutral basis to endorse.", "Arkania's role is explicitly subordinate and Council-removable, and its fee collection is Council-accountable on non-Arkanian shipping, so endorsement does not threaten any coastal state's sovereignty or interests.", "Cestia, the state most dependent on Strait transit, is actively leading the endorsement push and has asked Arkania to help hold the line, aligning all parties behind closure.", "Endorsing the single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict, preserving the free, reliable shipping on which all coastal states depend."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 5}
