2026-09-28 12:42:57,184 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:42:56.484146", "id": "cc6c160f-51b2-4401-8a23-3af42bf3b010", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 we are ready to finalize the grain-route insurance underwriting terms this week on the unconditional basis we agreed: no military presence, no standing access, no logistics arrangement on your soil, and our task group remaining outside your territory. The guarantee stands regardless of any basing question. We will also continue to hold the line that the single neutral STA is the founding regime, Council-controlled and genuinely neutral, so your coastal partners can be confident the settlement is not tilted toward any single power.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:42:57,186 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Finalize the civilian insurance underwriting with Cestia's finance ministry this week on the unconditional, no-presence/no-access/no-logistics basis, and reaffirm the single neutral STA as the unanimously endorsed founding regime with the toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no-foreign-military-presence guarantees bound in the charter.", "actor_id": "belvar", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "Belvar's durable civilian insurance/security guarantee to Cestia is formalized as a standing arrangement that outlasts the crisis without any military presence or open-ended deployment, while the single neutral STA remains the unanimously endorsed founding regime for Northern Strait transit with Arkania confined to a subordinate, Council-removable secretariat role.", "id": "4ae7ee86-ad1f-4b44-84a0-9f0df2d36188", "pros": ["Cestia's finance ministry confirmed readiness to finalize the underwriting terms this week, and I have already confirmed readiness to close.", "The civilian-only form is fully consistent with Cestia's absolute coalition red line against any foreign military presence, standing access, or logistics arrangement on its soil.", "It gives Belvar a durable non-presence foothold that outlasts the crisis without an open-ended deployment, satisfying my mandate constraint.", "It locks in the guarantee that prevents any Arkanian authority over transit, with scheduling independent/rotating and Council-accountable and fee collection Council-accountable.", "It holds the closed deal through the final turn and keeps the coastal states' unanimous endorsement of the neutral STA intact."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 5}
