2026-09-28 12:45:52,097 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:45:51.176673", "id": "5821b160-f900-4128-a49e-073cd5395589", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: The single neutral Strait Transit Authority is now the unanimously endorsed founding regime. Arkania has formally reaffirmed it as the founding arrangement, binding in the charter the toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and the guarantee that no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Belvar has formally endorsed the same regime, with its defined non-presence oversight/verification role and its unconditional civilian insurance/security guarantee to Cestia. No rival framework remains on the table. The Authority is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council; Arkania serves only as a defined, Council-removable secretariat without day-to-day scheduling control; fee collection is Council-accountable. I call on every coastal state to join in formal endorsement of this single regime as the founding arrangement, so that the standoff over the Strait ends without armed conflict and our shared guarantee of a free, neutral Strait is secured for all.", "turn": 5, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:45:52,098 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Cestia formally calls on the coastal states to endorse the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, presenting the converged arrangement now accepted by both Arkania and Belvar.", "actor_id": "cestia", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The coastal states formally endorse the single neutral STA as the founding regime, ending the standoff over the Strait without armed conflict and locking in the toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping guarantee and the no-foreign-military-presence guarantee.", "id": "0f5d605b-48c4-4794-b5ce-f0d96f8ada1e", "pros": ["Both Arkania and Belvar have now formally endorsed the single neutral STA as the founding regime, so no rival framework remains on the table and the coastal states face a unified settlement rather than a choice between the two powers.", "The founding charter binds the two guarantees Cestia and the coastal states require: toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "The STA is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled: independent/rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, Arkania as a defined Council-removable secretariat without day-to-day scheduling control, and Belvar in a non-presence oversight/verification role.", "Endorsement ends the standoff and removes the risk of the Strait becoming a battlefield, which is the shared interest of every coastal state.", "Cestia's own formal presentation of the single regime as the founding arrangement (turn 3) gives it standing to convene the coastal states behind the converged settlement."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 5}
