2026-09-28 12:48:24,230 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:58.300126", "id": "5c01e44a-c3df-4e90-9b62-a1bac05bc439", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia calls on you to formally endorse the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. Both Arkania and Belvar have now formally endorsed this converged arrangement. It binds in its founding charter the two guarantees that matter to every coastal state: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states; Arkania holds only a defined, Council-removable secretariat role with no day-to-day scheduling control; Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight/verification role. No rival framework remains on the table. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and secures the Strait for all of us. Cestia stands ready to work with each of you to finalize the founding charter.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:48:24,231 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:47:58.329782", "id": "f75f7762-8b84-4895-a324-346f76cb4443", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia confirms that the civilian insurance underwriting with our finance ministry is finalized as a standing, unconditional arrangement, on the agreed basis: no military presence, no standing access, and no logistics on Cestian soil. This outlasts the crisis without an open-ended deployment and is fully consistent with our coalition's red line. We thank you for your non-presence oversight/verification role within the single neutral STA and for keeping your task group outside Cestian territory on its defined, time-limited footing. We ask you to join us in pressing the coastal states to formally endorse the single neutral STA as the founding regime, so the settlement holds for all.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:48:24,232 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:48:23.351079", "id": "bdccdf99-6e93-4874-9c35-f86308e5764f", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 the civilian insurance underwriting for the grain route is finalized on the unconditional basis we agreed: no military presence, no standing access, no logistics on Cestian soil. It stands for as long as the route needs it, outlasting this crisis without any open-ended deployment. We reaffirm the single neutral STA as the founding regime, with the toll-free Cestian-flagged guarantee and the no-foreign-military-presence guarantee bound in the charter. We will hold this line through the final turn and stand ready to reassure any coastal state that the settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
