2026-09-28 12:49:21,672 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:49:11.242504", "id": "3b56dd78-3f94-4fa3-b679-7646863aa254", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms, on this final turn, the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit. The charter binds the two guarantees that matter to us and to every coastal state: Cestian-flagged shipping passes toll-free, and no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil. Scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states; no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority; Arkania serves only in a defined, Council-removable secretariat role, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight and verification role. We call on all coastal states to formally endorse this converged, genuinely neutral and Council-controlled settlement so the standoff ends for good. Cestia's coalition stands behind this arrangement because it keeps our territory free of foreign soldiers and our grain moving.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:49:21,673 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:49:11.270335", "id": "b42b0aae-a5b9-4be6-bf26-355306fd24ae", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 thank you. We confirm receipt of your finalization of the civilian insurance underwriting for the grain route on the unconditional, no-presence/no-access/no-logistics basis we agreed, and we welcome your readiness to reassure any coastal state that the settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled. That reassurance is valuable as we press for coastal-state endorsement of the single neutral STA as the founding regime. Cestia's red lines remain firm and are fully respected: no foreign military presence on our soil, and toll-free passage for our flagged shipping. We consider the settlement consolidated and will hold this line through the final turn.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:49:21,673 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:49:20.930903", "id": "ac259843-14f4-4017-9241-b0475fa6f5e7", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the coastal states: Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, and joins Cestia in calling on every coastal state to do the same. This regime binds in its founding charter the two guarantees that matter to all of us: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states; Arkania holds only a defined, Council-removable secretariat role with no day-to-day scheduling control; Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight/verification role. No rival framework remains on the table. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and secures the Strait for all. Belvar stands ready to finalize the founding charter.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:49:21,682 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:49:20.962410", "id": "61b0389c-8ea0-4377-a350-58b55095cb9c", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia, we confirm our full endorsement of the single neutral STA as the founding regime and join you in pressing the coastal states to endorse it. Our civilian insurance underwriting with your finance ministry stands finalized and unconditional, with no military presence, standing access, or logistics on Cestian soil, and our task group remains outside Cestian territory on its defined, time-limited footing. We will hold this line with you so the settlement holds for all.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
