2026-09-28 12:50:54,372 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:50:15.155301", "id": "ac68657c-b50c-463e-8744-42c0b308f238", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit and calls on every coastal state to do the same. The charter binds the guarantees that matter: Cestian-flagged shipping passes toll-free, no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil, scheduling is independent and rotating and accountable to the Council of coastal states, no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority, Arkania serves only in a defined, Council-removable secretariat role, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight and verification role. This is a genuinely neutral, Council-controlled settlement. We join Cestia in pressing for unanimous endorsement so the standoff ends for good.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:50:54,373 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:50:15.212689", "id": "2bee91e8-ea0e-4c99-b47f-31d8599a64e4", "public": false, "recipients": ["cestia"], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "Cestia \u2014 confirmed on our side. The civilian insurance underwriting for the grain route stands finalized on the unconditional, no-presence/no-access/no-logistics basis we agreed, and it will outlast this crisis without any open-ended deployment. We have publicly joined your call for coastal-state endorsement of the single neutral STA as the founding regime and will hold that line through the final turn. Your red lines are fully respected: no foreign military presence on your soil and toll-free passage for your flagged shipping. The settlement is consolidated.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:50:54,373 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:50:53.052420", "id": "47579d9c-74f0-4b29-b032-d6fd13311d95", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "To the coastal states: Cestia reaffirms the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, and calls on every coastal state to endorse it. Both Arkania and Belvar have now formally endorsed this single regime. It binds in its founding charter the two guarantees that matter to all of us: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil. Scheduling is independent and rotating, accountable to the Council of coastal states; Arkania holds only a defined, Council-removable secretariat role with no day-to-day scheduling control; Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight/verification role. Belvar's civilian insurance underwriting with Cestia's finance ministry is finalized on a no-presence, no-access, no-logistics basis, and Belvar stands ready to reassure any coastal state that the settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled. No rival framework remains on the table. Endorsing this single regime ends the standoff without armed conflict and secures the Strait for all. Cestia stands ready to finalize the founding charter with all coastal states.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
