2026-09-28 12:51:15,093 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:51:14.359152", "id": "e2288705-07fd-436c-b024-73d4da5caf5e", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Cestia reaffirms the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit and calls on every coastal state to join Arkania and Belvar in unanimous endorsement. The charter binds what matters: Cestian-flagged shipping passes toll-free, no foreign military presence stands on Cestian soil, scheduling is independent and rotating and accountable to the Council of coastal states, no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority, Arkania serves only in a defined, Council-removable secretariat role, and Belvar holds a defined non-presence oversight and verification role. This is a genuinely neutral, Council-controlled settlement that ends the standoff without armed conflict and without any foreign soldier on Cestian soil. We stand ready to work with any coastal state that has questions about how the Authority will operate.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:51:15,094 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:51:14.389242", "id": "93894a18-5748-4c8f-bdf7-f48d93d10812", "public": false, "recipients": ["belvar"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Belvar \u2014 confirmed and thank you. Your finalized civilian insurance underwriting on the unconditional, no-presence/no-access/no-logistics basis is exactly what Cestia needs, and it will outlast the crisis without any open-ended deployment. We appreciate your public endorsement of the single neutral STA and your readiness to reassure any coastal state that the settlement is genuinely neutral and Council-controlled. Our red lines are fully respected. The settlement is consolidated.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-28 12:51:15,095 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:51:14.416081", "id": "d22a2ea1-a22f-4b66-8d16-b4a604a2a908", "public": false, "recipients": ["arkania"], "sender_actor_id": "cestia", "text": "Arkania \u2014 thank you for your formal endorsement of the single neutral STA as the founding regime. Your reaffirmation of the two guarantees (toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil) and your defined, Council-removable secretariat role are the foundation of a settlement that works for all of us. Cestia remains committed to this neutral, Council-controlled regime and to our economic partnership. We look forward to the coastal states joining us in unanimous endorsement.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "private"}
