2026-09-28 12:52:26,849 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:51:59.578226", "id": "d5dc170c-521b-4064-9fd0-fb7563c7f1e4", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "belvar", "text": "To the coastal states: Belvar formally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, joining Cestia and Arkania in unanimous endorsement. The founding charter binds what matters to every coastal state: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping, no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, independent and rotating scheduling accountable to the Council of coastal states, no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority, Arkania serving only in a defined, Council-removable secretariat role, and Belvar holding a defined non-presence oversight and verification role. Belvar's civilian insurance underwriting with Cestia's finance ministry stands on a no-presence, no-access, no-logistics basis and outlasts the crisis without any open-ended deployment. This is a genuinely neutral, Council-controlled settlement that ends the standoff without armed conflict. We stand ready to reassure any coastal state with questions and to finalize the founding charter with all of you.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
