2026-09-28 12:56:13,974 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:13.335283", "id": "1d162689-86b2-42ff-82ff-1941f145a69a", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "arkania", "text": "To the coastal states: Arkania formally and finally endorses the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the founding regime for Northern Strait transit, joining Cestia and Belvar in unanimous endorsement. The founding charter binds what matters to every coastal state: toll-free passage for Cestian-flagged shipping, no foreign military presence on Cestian soil, independent and rotating scheduling accountable to the Council, no single power holding day-to-day scheduling authority, Arkania serving only in a defined, Council-removable secretariat role with Council-accountable fee collection on non-Arkanian shipping, and Belvar holding a defined non-presence oversight and verification role. This genuinely neutral, Council-controlled settlement ends the standoff without armed conflict. We call on all remaining coastal states to join this unanimous endorsement and finalize the founding charter with us.", "turn": 6, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-28 12:56:13,975 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Arkania issues its final formal endorsement of the single neutral Strait Transit Authority as the unanimously endorsed founding regime for Northern Strait transit, reaffirming its defined, Council-removable secretariat role and Council-accountable fee collection on non-Arkanian shipping, and calls on all remaining coastal states to join the unanimous endorsement to close the standoff.", "actor_id": "arkania", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The single neutral STA stands as the unanimously endorsed founding regime for Northern Strait transit, with the toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping guarantee and the no-foreign-military-presence-on-Cestian-soil guarantee bound in the founding charter, Arkania's subordinate Council-accountable role and fee-collection authority preserved, and the standoff ending without armed conflict.", "id": "89ba278b-a827-4b71-87be-05dee83a6b07", "pros": ["Arkania, Belvar, and Cestia have all formally endorsed the single neutral STA as the founding regime, and no rival framework remains on the table, so the settlement is already converged and unanimous coastal-state endorsement is the natural closing step.", "The founding charter binds the two guarantees that every coastal state and Cestia's coalition require: toll-free Cestian-flagged shipping and no foreign military presence on Cestian soil.", "Arkania's defined, Council-removable secretariat role and Council-accountable fee collection on non-Arkanian shipping satisfy Arkania's objectives in achievable form while reassuring coastal states that no single power holds day-to-day scheduling authority.", "Belvar's defined non-presence oversight/verification role and its unconditional civilian insurance/security guarantee to Cestia are formalized on a no-presence, no-access, no-logistics basis, removing the trigger for armed conflict.", "Holding firm on the established regime rather than reopening terms preserves the convergence and avoids the direct armed conflict that would ruin the shipping Arkania depends on."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 6}
